[0m[0m
- Converted the arithmetic that wraps in C ([38;5;10mlength[0m/[38;5;10mused_count[0m/[38;5;10mtombstone_count[0m/[38;5;10mremaining[0m inc/dec, [38;5;10mstrlen()+1[0m, threshold computations) to explicit [38;5;10mwrapping_*[0m. Previously the [38;5;10mdev[0m profile would have panicked where the C wraps silently.[0m[0m
